Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.01,0:00:09.36,Default,S,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.36,0:00:11.05,Default,S,0,0,0,,Switch after you've fired!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.05,0:00:11.86,Default,S,0,0,0,,Hurry, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.88,0:00:25.03,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Ninjas!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.70,0:00:30.08,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,There are enemies everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.62,0:00:32.31,Default,N,0,0,0,,We just have to keep running.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.31,0:00:35.05,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,But it's pitch black in these mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.51,0:00:38.53,Default,S,0,0,0,,If we can make it to Wakasa, the enemy will give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.53,0:00:39.56,Default,S,0,0,0,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.82,0:00:44.81,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,If you say so, brother, I think we might just survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.81,0:00:46.28,Default,S,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.28,0:00:50.09,Default,S,0,0,0,,If we make it back, Nobuna, Katsuie, and Nagahide,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.09,0:00:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,the prettiest girls in the Oda Clan,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.85,0:00:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,will be there to greet us with radiant smiles!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.95,0:01:00.92,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,Our boss's smile is enough for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.92,0:01:02.85,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,Small breasts are better than big ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.85,0:01:05.18,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,Girls who never get older are better than pretty ones!
