Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.72,0:02:43.93,Default,Ck,0,0,0,,Kill them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.39,0:02:49.77,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,Sagara, sir, we'll protect you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.75,0:02:53.52,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,Hasshi, take our brother and get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.52,0:02:55.67,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,General, we're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.40,0:02:57.35,Default,S,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.92,0:03:02.37,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,The Oda Clan's monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.37,0:03:06.87,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,{\q3}If it weren't for the castle you built at Sunomata, I would have...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.74,0:03:12.63,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,I will never forgive Oda Nobuna or her monkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.43,0:03:19.67,Default,S,0,0,0,,H-Hasshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.82,0:03:25.89,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,I won't let go even when I'm dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.52,0:03:30.30,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,General, get out of here...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.30,0:03:31.63,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,While you can...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.63,0:03:32.40,Default,S,0,0,0,,I can't leave y—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.40,0:03:34.76,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.90,0:03:38.73,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.61,0:03:40.61,Default,S,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.49,0:03:42.53,Default,S,0,0,0,,Hasshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.74,0:03:46.08,Default,S,0,0,0,,Hasshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.80,0:03:49.80,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Boss...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.75,0:03:56.06,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,A man like you is wasted on the Oda Clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.72,0:03:59.65,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,You may keep that spear as a reward for your valiance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.43,0:04:22.98,Default,H,0,0,0,,Mr. Yoshiharu...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.79,0:04:38.18,Default,Nene,0,0,0,,Brother, come home safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.07,0:04:43.76,Default,H,0,0,0,,How many survived?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.40,0:04:47.87,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,A few Owari soldiers are still fighting,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.87,0:04:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,but it was such a mess back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.77,0:04:51.99,Default,S,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.99,0:04:52.72,Default,S,0,0,0,,We have to go save—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.72,0:04:53.23,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.65,0:04:55.47,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,If you go back, you'll be killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.47,0:04:55.90,Default,S,0,0,0,,But...!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.74,0:04:59.53,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,They stayed of their own free will...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.51,0:05:02.62,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,to protect {\i1}you{\i0}, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.17,0:05:11.44,Default,BadGuy,0,0,0,,The Magara sisters have done splendidly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.44,0:05:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy's rear guard is crumbling.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.21,0:05:19.13,Default,Y,0,0,0,,Some flowers only bloom on the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.53,0:05:25.80,Default,Y,0,0,0,,I hope to make the Oda princess bloom in my arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.23,0:05:30.31,Default,OtherBadGuys,0,0,0,,I guess we were too late to the battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.31,0:05:32.64,Default,OtherBadGuys,0,0,0,,Nobuna has already withdrawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.64,0:05:36.02,Default,OtherBadGuys,0,0,0,,All that's left is a force of 500 led by Sagara Yoshiharu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.50,0:05:38.23,Default,OtherBadGuys,0,0,0,,Oda's monkey?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.77,0:05:41.13,Default,OtherBadGuys,0,0,0,,Nagamasa was impressed by him, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.96,0:05:43.40,Default,OtherBadGuys,0,0,0,,All forces attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.82,0:05:48.00,Default,OtherBadGuys,0,0,0,,The glory of killing Sagara Yoshiharu belongs to the Asai Clan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.75,0:05:53.28,Default,M,0,0,0,,Miss Mitsuhide?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.80,0:05:57.54,Default,A,0,0,0,,{\q3}There really is no way Mister Monkey will survive on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.03,0:06:00.33,Default,M,0,0,0,,I don't think so either, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.25,0:06:04.84,Default,I,0,0,0,,I'm going to save Yoshiharu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.51,0:06:07.26,Default,A,0,0,0,,I won't let you go alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.75,0:06:10.51,Default,M,0,0,0,,I can't run away by myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.91,0:06:17.24,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,Where is Sagara Yoshiharu?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.24,0:06:18.27,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,Find him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.82,0:06:20.73,Default,Magara,0,0,0,,Don't let the Asai get him first!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.73,0:06:22.90,Default,Magara,0,0,0,,We will take the enemy general's life!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.02,0:06:28.34,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.63,0:06:32.62,Default,S,0,0,0,,Rokurouta!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.64,0:06:34.59,Default,S,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.74,0:06:41.62,Default,Z,0,0,0,,The enemy is after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.64,0:06:46.04,Default,Ha,0,0,0,,To win a war, you slay the enemy general.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.04,0:06:49.33,Default,Ha,0,0,0,,Especially if that general is the hero of Sunomata.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.33,0:06:51.64,Default,Ha,0,0,0,,The bounty on your head is probably worth a fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.39,0:06:55.56,Default,S,0,0,0,,I'm not worth anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.27,0:06:58.40,Default,Z,0,0,0,,A bounty, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.40,0:07:02.56,Default,Z,0,0,0,,I suppose we could kill Sagara ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.51,0:07:04.54,Default,Ha,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.38,0:07:09.70,Default,Ha,0,0,0,,We certainly can't let him escape now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.70,0:07:11.29,Default,S,0,0,0,,I'm not going anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.83,0:07:15.33,Default,S,0,0,0,,I'm going to stay here with my\Ncomrades and fight to the death!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.29,0:07:19.96,Default,Ha,0,0,0,,I'm sure that corpse there is glad to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.39,0:07:23.18,Default,Ha,0,0,0,,The man he sacrificed his life to protect
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.18,0:07:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,has chosen to die like a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.67,0:07:31.04,Default,Z,0,0,0,,Oda Nobuna wanted to say what you just have.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.04,0:07:33.97,Default,Z,0,0,0,,However, she chose to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.70,0:07:35.97,Default,S,0,0,0,,Nobuna is needed...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.14,0:07:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,by the country, by everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.60,0:07:42.94,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\t(685,1311,\alpha&HFF&)}But I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.34,0:07:44.98,Default,Ha,0,0,0,,Then it doesn't matter if you die?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.73,0:07:48.21,Default,S,0,0,0,,What would you have me do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.25,0:07:51.56,Default,Z,0,0,0,,The question is what you'll use your life for.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.19,0:07:54.74,Default,Z,0,0,0,,Can you die for your companions?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.64,0:08:00.24,Default,S,0,0,0,,I don't want to die...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.74,0:08:05.04,Default,S,0,0,0,,but I can't stand leaving\Nthem behind and running!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.04,0:08:06.94,Default,S,0,0,0,,I'm a greedy person!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.94,0:08:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to have everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.28,0:08:14.01,Default,Ha,0,0,0,,In that case... just die here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.80,0:08:17.64,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,What the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.10,0:08:24.49,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Monkey of the Oda Clan... come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.86,0:08:26.71,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.95,0:08:29.61,Default,S,0,0,0,,We're going to scatter and run.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.61,0:08:31.67,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.67,0:08:33.61,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,We were order to protect you by the bos—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.61,0:08:35.00,Default,S,0,0,0,,We need to do it to survive!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.00,0:08:37.24,Default,S,0,0,0,,If we stay together, we'll be wiped out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.09,0:08:42.04,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Don't die, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.03,0:08:43.91,Default,S,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.90,0:08:48.14,Default,N,0,0,0,,The princess is back?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.68,0:08:49.96,Default,N,0,0,0,,Is she okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.47,0:08:59.47,Default,N,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.90,0:09:02.93,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Don't tell anyone what you see here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.35,0:09:11.65,Default,Mask,0,0,0,,This is the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.22,0:09:14.40,Default,S,0,0,0,,You're only after me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.40,0:09:18.03,Default,S,0,0,0,,My men, can you let them go?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.03,0:09:19.44,Default,S,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.44,0:09:22.64,Default,S,0,0,0,,A samurai can at least listen to\Nsomebody's last request, can't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.17,0:09:25.76,Default,Mask,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.76,0:09:29.04,Default,Mask,0,0,0,,They are all worth far more than you. {why is this line commented?}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.53,0:09:32.04,Default,S,0,0,0,,Thanks, masked man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.93,0:09:37.30,Default,Mask,0,0,0,,I will speak to Yoshikage about your soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.30,0:09:40.18,Default,Mask,0,0,0,,You can die with no regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.31,0:09:43.43,Default,A,0,0,0,,Mister Monkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.32,0:09:49.44,Default,Ha,0,0,0,,It would be humiliating to have your life taken by the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.98,0:09:50.82,Default,M,0,0,0,,Mr. Hanzou!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.82,0:09:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.27,0:09:55.44,Default,Ha,0,0,0,,Farewell, Sagara Yoshiharu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.81,0:10:02.78,Default,K,0,0,0,,Yoshiharu!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.86,0:10:05.96,Default,A,0,0,0,,M-Monkey...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.17,0:10:13.25,Default,M,0,0,0,,Miss Mitsuhide!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.67,0:10:13.25,Alt,I,0,0,0,,Juubei!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.21,0:10:21.01,Default,I,0,0,0,,Juubei!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.75,0:10:25.88,Default,A,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mr... Sagara.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.46,0:10:34.65,Default,Ne,0,0,0,,Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.61,0:10:38.20,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,She survived, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.16,0:10:40.66,Default,N,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.66,0:10:42.37,Default,N,0,0,0,,But what about Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.02,0:10:47.37,Default,N,0,0,0,,Isn't that... his?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.13,0:10:53.00,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,She took off her armor, but she still had this with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.01,0:10:57.85,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,The bullet struck it and lost most of its momentum.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.64,0:11:00.76,Default,K,0,0,0,,Monkey...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.33,0:11:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Even in death, he protected the princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.93,0:11:06.17,Default,Ne,0,0,0,,He's dead?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.68,0:11:07.91,Default,Ne,0,0,0,,The princess...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.59,0:11:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The princess abandoned him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.26,0:11:13.69,Default,N,0,0,0,,Run...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.23,0:11:17.19,Default,N,0,0,0,,Run, Monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.52,0:11:18.74,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,She's talking in her sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.39,0:11:22.95,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,She's been calling his name the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.95,0:11:26.28,Default,N,0,0,0,,Don't die, Monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.84,0:11:29.15,Default,Ne,0,0,0,,Princess...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.49,0:11:31.96,Default,Ns,0,0,0,,My sister is critically injured?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.44,0:11:34.14,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,The guards were talking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.14,0:11:37.03,Default,Nm,0,0,0,,She was shot and may not survive the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.03,0:11:38.21,Default,Ns,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.98,0:11:40.20,Default,Ns,0,0,0,,Sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.22,0:11:42.37,Default,Ns,0,0,0,,Let me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.37,0:11:45.22,Default,Ns,0,0,0,,Somebody let me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.22,0:11:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.85,0:11:50.43,Default,Konoe,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.85,0:11:52.96,Default,Sugitani,0,0,0,,She should have died instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.96,0:11:53.94,Default,Sugitani,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.45,0:11:55.89,Default,Sugitani,0,0,0,,How is she still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.69,0:11:59.44,Default,Sugitani,0,0,0,,Does Oda Nobuna have divine protection?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.92,0:12:02.20,Default,Konoe,0,0,0,,She's as good as dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.92,0:12:04.11,Default,Sugitani,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.02,0:12:07.61,Default,MonkDude,0,0,0,,He won't be of any use to us anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.79,0:12:09.74,Default,Konoe,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.74,0:12:12.72,Default,Konoe,0,0,0,,He's played his part.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.42,0:12:20.84,Default,Narr,0,0,0,,The Asakura-Asai force marched through Kanegasaki, 35,000 strong, and headed for Kyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.93,0:12:27.14,Default,Narr,0,0,0,,The Oda forces, led by Shibata Katsuie, met them with an army of 15,000,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.14,0:12:31.77,Default,Narr,0,0,0,,and the two forces faced off in Sakamoto, near Hiei Mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.40,0:12:34.89,Default,Narr,0,0,0,,If the enemy broke through, Kyo would be lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.89,0:12:41.85,Default,Narr,0,0,0,,The Oda forces were in grave peril\Nwithout the aid of their leader, Nobuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.28,0:12:44.28,Default,K,0,0,0,,What did you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.80,0:12:47.03,Default,K,0,0,0,,Yoshiharu was blown apart?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.60,0:12:50.84,Default,H,0,0,0,,Brother! Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.17,0:12:58.16,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Why would Hattori Hanzou do such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.61,0:13:01.02,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Bring Hanzou here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.02,0:13:01.42,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,I want—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.42,0:13:06.65,Default,D,0,0,0,,He has most likely returned to \NMikawa with Motoyasu by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.38,0:13:10.22,Default,D,0,0,0,,The Oda forces have suffered a great loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.98,0:13:13.48,Default,D,0,0,0,,For now, the issue is the princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.48,0:13:16.73,Default,D,0,0,0,,If she learns that Sagara Yoshiharu died,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.73,0:13:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,she'll lose the strength to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.15,0:13:23.46,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Do you know anything about medicine?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.46,0:13:26.11,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Can't you save her somehow?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.19,0:13:29.16,Default,D,0,0,0,,An illness of the heart...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.99,0:13:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,is beyond the reach of medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.12,0:13:35.31,Default,I,0,0,0,,Princess...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.90,0:13:39.00,Default,D,0,0,0,,There's one other way, and it's not easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.00,0:13:44.34,Default,D,0,0,0,,We'll have to have her accept\NSagara Yoshiharu's death...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.17,0:13:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,on her own.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.41,0:13:49.18,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,If you do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.94,0:13:53.89,Default,D,0,0,0,,She may never wake again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.02,0:13:57.87,Default,D,0,0,0,,It's a gamble.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.49,0:14:04.15,Default,L,0,0,0,,Do you swear to love her forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.35,0:14:07.52,Default,S,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.95,0:14:10.36,Default,M,0,0,0,,Monkey! You're safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.36,0:14:11.37,Default,S,0,0,0,,Hey, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.37,0:14:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't space out during our wedding ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.41,0:14:20.72,Default,L,0,0,0,,Oda Nobuna,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.33,0:14:23.46,Default,L,0,0,0,,do you swear to take Sagara Yoshiharu as your husband,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.11,0:14:26.97,Default,L,0,0,0,,and love him for the rest of your days?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.23,0:14:34.06,Default,N,0,0,0,,Everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.63,0:14:38.06,Default,N,0,0,0,,This can't be happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.92,0:14:42.36,Default,N,0,0,0,,Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.26,0:14:44.64,Default,N,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.64,0:14:46.37,Default,N,0,0,0,,This is a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.17,0:14:48.95,Default,L,0,0,0,,Do you swear to love him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.53,0:14:51.87,Default,N,0,0,0,,If it's just a dream...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.18,0:14:54.88,Default,N,0,0,0,,Yes, I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.10,0:15:00.46,Default,L,0,0,0,,Then you may kiss the bride.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.64,0:15:04.13,Default,S,0,0,0,,It's been a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.33,0:15:10.26,Default,S,0,0,0,,It's finally time for you to give me my reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.26,0:15:14.19,Default,N,0,0,0,,Yes, the prettiest girl in Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.19,0:15:16.77,Default,N,0,0,0,,Sorry it took so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.36,0:15:18.31,Default,S,0,0,0,,Nobuna...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.50,0:15:20.61,Default,N,0,0,0,,Yoshiharu...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.85,0:15:24.92,Default,N,0,0,0,,Monkey?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.94,0:15:26.97,Default,N,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.45,0:15:34.67,Default,N,0,0,0,,Monkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.21,0:15:38.94,Default,N,0,0,0,,He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.67,0:15:42.55,Default,N,0,0,0,,I knew it. Of course he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.55,0:15:43.83,Default,N,0,0,0,,This is reality.{MISTIMED}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.24,0:15:48.21,Default,N,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.87,0:15:51.87,Default,N,0,0,0,,Monkey...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.73,0:15:53.78,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.21,0:15:57.85,Default,D,0,0,0,,I believed that you'd wake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.85,0:15:58.99,Default,I,0,0,0,,I'm so glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.96,0:16:02.08,Default,N,0,0,0,,My head's all fuzzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.42,0:16:07.36,Default,D,0,0,0,,I used my medicine to connect dream and reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.39,0:16:11.57,Default,I,0,0,0,,Princess, you're still hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.57,0:16:12.82,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,You must lie down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.86,0:16:16.63,Default,N,0,0,0,,Monkey's dead, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.40,0:16:19.83,Default,N,0,0,0,,He's dead, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.83,0:16:22.60,Default,D,0,0,0,,He was blown apart by a bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.60,0:16:24.83,Default,D,0,0,0,,They couldn't even find a body.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.27,0:16:26.76,Default,I,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.30,0:16:29.59,Default,I,0,0,0,,I couldn't save Yoshiharu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.73,0:16:31.80,Default,N,0,0,0,,That's right...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.61,0:16:34.41,Default,N,0,0,0,,I can't see him anymore, can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.41,0:16:38.10,Default,D,0,0,0,,Akechi Mitsuhide was also killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.57,0:16:39.89,Default,N,0,0,0,,Juubei, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.76,0:16:43.04,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,It was a noble sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.04,0:16:47.88,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,For their sakes, you must unite Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.88,0:16:49.61,Default,N,0,0,0,,Unite Japan...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.41,0:16:53.39,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,The enemies who would stand in your way are still strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.39,0:16:56.86,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,The ones who took them from you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.86,0:16:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you let them get away with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.89,0:17:02.79,Default,N,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.39,0:17:04.45,Default,D,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.08,0:17:06.83,Default,D,0,0,0,,You must take revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.78,0:17:10.82,Default,N,0,0,0,,I must take revenge for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.33,0:17:15.58,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,What were you thinking, Danjo?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.08,0:17:19.44,Default,D,0,0,0,,Lord Nobuna needs something to keep her going.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.44,0:17:22.72,Default,D,0,0,0,,Something to give her strength, besides Sagara Yoshiharu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.30,0:17:24.56,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,But even so...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.08,0:17:28.61,Default,D,0,0,0,,In that respect, rage is the greatest power of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.61,0:17:32.24,Default,D,0,0,0,,Now she's certain to unite Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.51,0:17:42.16,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Inuchiyo, go find our strategist.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.94,0:17:44.50,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,This feels terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.45,0:17:46.50,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Three points.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.97,0:17:53.13,Default,ThatMerchantGuy,0,0,0,,Trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.67,0:17:56.78,Default,ThatMerchantGuy,0,0,0,,Oda's forces have burnt down Tennoujiya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.37,0:17:59.93,Default,ThatMerchantGuy,0,0,0,,And they say the princess ordered it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.74,0:18:02.43,Default,L,0,0,0,,Miss Nobuna did?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.01,0:18:07.18,Default,ThatMerchantGuy,0,0,0,,Sakai is supposed to be off limits to all the counts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.91,0:18:10.94,Default,ThatMerchantGuy,0,0,0,,What's happened to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.53,0:18:30.40,Default,RandomGuy,0,0,0,,They've lost their minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.40,0:18:32.85,Default,RandomGuy,0,0,0,,Without Nobuna, the Oda army is...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.18,0:18:37.24,Default,RandomGuy,0,0,0,,O-Oda Nobuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.43,0:18:43.26,Default,N,0,0,0,,We're here to avenge Monkey and Juubei!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.26,0:18:46.14,Default,N,0,0,0,,Kill every last one of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.09,0:18:49.20,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,That's definitely Oda Nobuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.20,0:18:50.94,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,My lord, the order to attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.21,0:18:54.45,Default,RG,0,0,0,,We can't possibly win!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.45,0:18:55.90,Default,RG,0,0,0,,Flee to Oumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.53,0:18:58.41,Default,RG,0,0,0,,Retreat!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.36,0:19:00.84,Default,Ninja,0,0,0,,What shall we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.47,0:19:05.21,Default,Y,0,0,0,,This is how I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.06,0:19:08.35,Default,Y,0,0,0,,Send all forces to Hiei Mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.35,0:19:09.96,Default,Ninja,0,0,0,,We're going to let them besiege us?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.69,0:19:11.83,Default,Y,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.83,0:19:16.32,Default,Y,0,0,0,,This is all part of my plan to make Nobuna mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.84,0:19:25.72,Default,Y,0,0,0,,Konoe and Tsuda have fled to Hiei Mountain,\Nalong with the Asakura forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.68,0:19:28.60,Default,N,0,0,0,,We won't let them escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.12,0:19:31.83,Default,D,0,0,0,,Our forces have completely surrounded Hiei Mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.83,0:19:33.67,Default,D,0,0,0,,Let's attack immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.55,0:19:35.73,Default,N,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.73,0:19:36.89,Default,K,0,0,0,,Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.89,0:19:40.36,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Hiei Mountain is a center of the people's faith!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.37,0:19:43.19,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,If we attack it, the people will turn against us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.19,0:19:44.87,Default,N,0,0,0,,I've made my decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.87,0:19:46.86,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Please reconsider!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.86,0:19:51.62,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,If the people turn against us,\Nthen what have we fought for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.63,0:19:53.49,Default,N,0,0,0,,Monkey is dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.49,0:19:54.90,Default,N,0,0,0,,So is Juubei!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.90,0:19:56.60,Default,N,0,0,0,,Doesn't that bother you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.60,0:19:58.49,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Making military decisions based on hatred?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.49,0:19:59.38,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Zero points.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.38,0:20:01.86,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,If we don't fight for the people of Japan,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.86,0:20:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,they won't fight for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.58,0:20:04.27,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.26,0:20:05.76,Default,K,0,0,0,,Please, Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.39,0:20:14.56,Default,Tsuda,0,0,0,,{\q3}As I thought, they're not willing to attack this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.57,0:20:18.91,Default,Tsuda,0,0,0,,If we stay here, we'll soon be completely surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.96,0:20:21.82,Default,Shoukaku,0,0,0,,Tsuda, actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.82,0:20:23.48,Default,Konoe,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.48,0:20:27.08,Default,Konoe,0,0,0,,Let us have Tsuda be our messenger of peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.65,0:20:28.70,Default,Tsuda,0,0,0,,Peace?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.70,0:20:29.83,Default,Tsuda,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.37,0:20:33.83,Default,Konoe,0,0,0,,Buy time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.87,0:20:39.21,Default,N,0,0,0,,You've got guts to show your face here, Tsuda Soukyuu.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.55,0:20:45.22,Default,Tsuda,0,0,0,,Advisor Konoe has sent me with a letter\Nand gift, as an envoy of peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.94,0:20:47.80,Default,N,0,0,0,,It's too late for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.26,0:20:49.64,Default,K,0,0,0,,This is heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.64,0:20:51.29,Default,K,0,0,0,,What did they send?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.00,0:20:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.31,0:21:02.18,Default,Konoe,0,0,0,,Did you like my gift, Oda Nobuna?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.18,0:21:05.87,Default,Konoe,0,0,0,,I'm told your own monkey didn't leave a body behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.87,0:21:10.04,Default,Konoe,0,0,0,,All this happened because a country\Ngirl refused to know her place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.41,0:21:12.63,Default,Konoe,0,0,0,,This is the least I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.63,0:21:15.79,Default,Konoe,0,0,0,,Take this head and return to the countryside.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.79,0:21:20.34,Default,Konoe,0,0,0,,If you don't change your ways, more will die needlessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.34,0:21:25.84,Default,Konoe,0,0,0,,I will take your head, those of your retainers, and your family's.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.26,0:21:27.35,Default,N,0,0,0,,He won't get away with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.15,0:21:30.01,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.46,0:21:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.92,0:21:34.98,Default,Tsuda,0,0,0,,They didn't tell me anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.48,0:21:39.74,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Wait! Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.74,0:21:41.23,Default,K,0,0,0,,Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.23,0:21:42.84,Default,K,0,0,0,,After me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.84,0:21:44.24,Default,K,0,0,0,,We'll follow the princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.41,0:21:46.31,Default,Ninja,0,0,0,,An attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.31,0:21:48.37,Default,Ninja,0,0,0,,The princess has attacked!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.84,0:21:50.45,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,How could this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.49,0:21:52.93,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Was this your plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.83,0:21:56.05,Default,D,0,0,0,,It's all for her own good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.12,0:21:59.24,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Messengers!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.24,0:22:00.72,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,All forces are to attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.72,0:22:03.35,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,But don't attack independently.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.35,0:22:05.54,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Work together with the other squads!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.54,0:22:06.26,Default,Messenger,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.88,0:22:09.56,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,Do we have no choice?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.10,0:22:11.27,Default,Nh,0,0,0,,One point.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.58,0:22:15.90,Default,N,0,0,0,,I won't forgive them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.51,0:22:18.36,Default,N,0,0,0,,I'll {\i1}never{\i0} forgive them.
